1144
01:07:20.824 --> 01:07:23.360
I was the first of
my friends to get a car.

1145
01:07:27.497 --> 01:07:30.931
It was winter break
and we were having this...

1146
01:07:30.933 --> 01:07:32.937
great night and...

1147
01:07:35.272 --> 01:07:38.275
